OL,3,GNEWSAThis year's harvest 'a two out of
OL,4,A10', farmer says
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Terrible", "disappointing" and "a two
OL,7,Fout of ten".
OL,9,FThat is how the famers I have met
OL,10,Ftravelling across the Midlands over the
OL,11,Fpast few days have described this
OL,12,Fyear's harvest. In short, they have not
OL,13,Fhad a good year.
OL,15,FAt the heart of this is the weather.
OL,16,FThe end of last year was fairly wet,
OL,17,Fwhich let some winter crops get well
OL,18,Festablished with time to put down
OL,19,Fdeeper roots before the rain stopped
OL,20,Fand the heat began.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
